<view class="page">
  <view class="topbar">
    <view>
      <view class="title">点菜记录</view>
      <view class="subtitle">每顿饭吃了什么、用了多少食材都在这</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="id">
    <view class="row">
      <view>
        <view class="name">{{item.createdAt}}</view>
        <view class="meta">{{item.dishCount}} 道菜，消耗 {{item.consumed.length}} 种食材<text wx:if="{{item.shortageCount}}" class="warn">（{{item.shortageCount}} 种不足）</text></view>
      </view>
      <button class="danger-btn" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="confirmRemove">删除</button>
    </view>

    <view class="dish-line" wx:for="{{item.dishes}}" wx:for-item="dish" wx:key="name">
      <text>{{dish.name}}</text>
      <text class="dish-tag">{{dish.type === 'recipe' ? '菜谱' : '自制'}}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="consume" wx:if="{{item.consumed.length}}">
      <view class="consume-title">食材消耗</view>
      <view class="consume-line" wx:for="{{item.consumed}}" wx:for-item="c" wx:key="name">
        <text class="c-name">{{c.name}}</text>
        <text class="c-num">用 {{c.consumed}}{{c.unit}} / 需 {{c.required}}{{c.unit}}</text>
        <text class="c-short" wx:if="{{c.shortage > 0}}">缺 {{c.shortage}}{{c.unit}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="note" wx:if="{{item.note}}">{{item.note}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!orders.length}}">
    暂时没有记录。去“今日点菜”做一顿饭吧。
  </view>
</view>
